    <summary>Clean, professional PDF editor for Windows. No subscription, no account, no telemetry.</summary>
    <description>StealthPDF is a clean, professional PDF editor for Windows. View, annotate, edit, OCR, scan, merge, split, compress, stamp, fill, sign, unlock, print, and flatten PDFs locally - no account, no telemetry, and no cloud upload.

**Features:**

- High-quality rendering via PDFium, with tabs, outlines, search, and four view modes
- Image-level PDF compression that preserves rotation and selectable text
- Built-in OCR (Tesseract) with bundled English/Nepali models; more languages on demand
- Scan from WIA and TWAIN scanners straight to PDF
- Inline text editing, annotations, stamps, watermarks, and page numbers
- Fill &amp; Sign: forms, checkmarks, and reusable signatures; digital signing support
- Merge, split, rotate, crop, reorder, flatten, repair, and unlock PDFs
- Single portable Windows EXE - or a per-user install with shortcuts and file association
- GPLv3, local-only, no account, no telemetry

StealthPDF is a community fork/rebrand of KillerPDF by Steve the Killer, maintained by @aabhpsy.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/aabhpsy/StealthPDF/releases/tag/vREPLACE_VERSION</releaseNotes>
